  "title": "Chapter Chartering Application",
  "description": "<div style=\"margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;\">\n    <p><strong>This form is the first step to officially chartering your local chapter with the Missouri Young Democrats.</strong></p>\n    <p>Be sure to review the <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1234567890/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Chapter Guide</a> for an overview of the chartering process.</p>\n    <p>By completing it, you'll help us recognize your chapter, connect you with statewide resources, and ensure your members are part of a growing network of young leaders across Missouri.</p>\n  </div>",
